(3) Following installation or maintenance on the automatic pressure altitude reporting system of the ATC transponder where data correspondence error could be introduced, the integrated system has been tested, inspected, and found to comply with paragraph (c), appendix E, of [part 43 of this chapter](https://ecfr.federalregister.gov/current/title-14/part-43).
(b) The tests required by [paragraph (a)](https://ecfr.federalregister.gov/current/title-14/section-91.411#p-91.411(a)) of this section must be conducted by—
(1) The manufacturer of the airplane, or helicopter, on which the tests and inspections are to be performed;
